      "caption": "Joint feature permutation and an additive interaction contrast for five held-out NASA ExtraTrees fits (seed 42). Each point averages ten permutations; bars are pointwise 95% intervals from 10,000 paired battery-cluster resamples, conditional on fitted models. Temperature has six features and voltage six. Within-battery shuffling preserves each cell's exposure context. The interaction contrast is Δ(T,V) − Δ(T) − Δ(V); it is a predictive perturbation diagnostic, not a causal interaction or multiplicity-adjusted test.",
